# The Telegram relay source stays OUT of the public repo.
# It is deployed from the Google Apps Script editor directly, and the
# deployment needs the real bot token / chat id / GitHub token which live
# in Script Properties (never in code). Keeping the file here public would
# only invite abuse - the live deployment URL is what matters.
google_apps_script.js

# Owner-only creator tools - never published (GitHub Pages serves this repo).
tools/

# Owner-only documents. The owner works on these locally; they are not
# part of the public site and are never published.
OWNER-MANUAL.md
RELAY-SETUP.md

# local scratch
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.env
.env.local
